- Initial package of python-sqlite-vec 0.1.9:
  * Vector search SQLite loadable (vec0) and Python API
    (sqlite_vec.load, serialize_float32/int8)
  * Built from the GitHub tag archive (PyPI is wheels-only)
  * vec0.so is built from sqlite-vec.c with system sqlite3
    headers; static libsqlite_vec0.a is not shipped

